% Scenario: a calibrated RGB space is selected (PLRM3 section 4.8.3).
% A CIEBasedABC dictionary with only its white point is accepted; the
% initial colour is zero in every component, and currentrgbcolor,
% currentgray, and currentcmykcolor answer the initial values of their
% device spaces rather than converting.
[/CIEBasedABC << /WhitePoint [0.9505 1 1.089] >>] setcolorspace
currentcolor == == ==
currentrgbcolor == == ==
currentgray ==
currentcmykcolor == == == ==
